    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Bowe Property are delighted to present to the market, Valley View, Curraghcrowley, Ballineen. Set on a wonderful, private, elevated setting overlooking the surrounding countryside of Enniskeane and Ballineen and its rich agricultural hinterlands, this is a wonderful private property, set on approximately 5 acres, with a long, tree lined approach to an elevated setting with an exceptional private and mature setting. The main residence is a traditional three bay, two storey farmhouse with a barn conversion extension, and the property is benefited by a sympathetic and very impressive renovation and refurbishment. With extensive accommodation consisting of four bedrooms, three bathrooms, two reception rooms, home office, a wonderful kitchen/dining room with a complimenting utility area. In addition, a detached stone-built cottage lies adjacent to the main residence, which has been sympathetically restored to a habitable condition with further use potential. A large storage corrugated shed offers enormous versatile space for stables, secure storage, and a host of other potential uses. The property's 5 acres consist of woodlands with native trees, grass paddocks, secret gardens, and much more. A former detached outbuilding has been repurposed as a gym and offers further versatile space, but it is the property's setting within 2km of Ballineen and Enniskeane Villages, 14km off Clonakilty, and 18km off Bandon Town, with its elevated and private setting, that sets this property apart as a most unique traditional small landholding with two traditional houses and two storey cottage. For those seeking privacy, convenience with a property with huge versatility, charm, and absolute beauty in terms of its setting and outlook, will find Curraghcrowley a difficult prospect to ignore. Viewing comes highly recommended, and the property has to be viewed to truly appreciate its entire setting offering.\r\nViewings are now openly invited and are strictly by prior appointment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall  - 2.79m x 1.28m\r\nAccess to lounge and reception room. Stairs to overhead accommodation. Wooden floor. Recessed coconut mat. Radiator. \r\n\r\nLounge  - 4.19m x 4.06m \r\nWindow to front. Window to rear. Ceiling wooden beams. Open solid fuel fireplace. Wooden floor. TV point. Telephone point. Radiator. \r\n\r\n\r\nReception Room - 4.02m x 4.64m \r\nAccess to kitchen/dining room and rear office. Window to front. range cooker alcove with overhead wooden mantel. Access to three storage spaces. Wooden floor. Recessed coconut mat. \r\n\r\n\r\nOffice - 3.33m x 4.47m \r\nAccess to side entertainment patio. Window to rear. Recessed lighting. Wooden floor. TV point. Radiator. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room - 8.67m x 4.50m\r\nFully fitted with presses & cupboards. Appliances include solid fuel range cooker, double electric oven with hob & overhead extractor, dishwasher & fridge/freezer. Earthenware sink. Ceramic tiled splashback. Feature island unit with extensive integrated drawer storage. Access to utility room. Ceramic tiled floor in kitchen area & wooden floor in dining area. Two windows to side. One window to front. Two automated Velux windows to rear. Feature half door to side. Coconut recessed mat. Solid oak ceiling wooden beams. Recessed lighting. Radiator. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nUtility Room - 1.82m x 1.94m\r\nPlumbed and fitted with washing services. Access into wash room. Ceramic tiled floor. Fitted solar panel system. Radiator. \r\n\r\n\r\nShower Room - 1.87m x 1.36m \r\nFully fitted with w.c., wash-hand basin & wall mounted shower. Ceramic tiled floor and walls. Frosted window to the rear. Radiator. \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding -2.97m x 5.61m\r\nAccess to all bedrooms. Wooden floor. Centre chandelier light piece. Velux window to rear. Stairs up to rear green house lobby. Radiator.\r\nRear green house lobby (1.39m x 1.39m) \r\nAccess to rear green house area. Ceramic tiled steps & floor. Recessed lighting.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom One - 2.99m x 4.17m \r\nWindow to front. Centre chandelier light piece. Ceiling wooden beams. Wooden floor. Access to ensuite & walk-in robe. Access to attic. TV point. Radiator. \r\nEnsuite (1.05m x 3.04m)\r\nFully fitted with w.c., wash-basin & shower unit with rainforest shower head,  accessed via bi-fold door. Ceramic tiled floors and walls. Window to rear. Radiator. \r\nWalk-In Robe (1.06m x 1.17m)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom Two - 2.87m x 1.93m \r\nWindow to front. Wooden floor. Radiator. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom Three - 3.02m x 2.89m \r\nWindow to front. Wooden floor. Robe area. Attic hatch. Radiator. \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom Four Lobby  - 1.20m x 1.75m\r\nAccess to wash room, bedroom four and airing cupboard. Wall light. Wooden floor. \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom Four - 2.96m x 4.57m \r\nWindow to front. Window to side. Wooden floor. Robe area. Attic hatch. Radiator. \r\n\r\n\r\nWash Room  - 3.47m x 1.77m\r\nFully fitted with w.c., wash-hand basin &  oversized corner shower unit accessed via sliding door. Ceramic tiled floor, splashback & shower surround. Velux window to rear.   Access to storage space. Radiator.\r\n\r\n\r\nGranny Flat\r\n\r\n\r\nGranny Flat Room 1  - 4.44m x 2.74m \r\nWooden panelling ceiling. Window to front. Frosted window to rear. Freestanding appliances include fridge/freezer, freezer & washing machine. Access to granny flat room two. Radiator. \r\n\r\n\r\nGranny Flat Room 2  - 2.75m x 4.45m \r\nWooden paneling ceiling. Window to rear. Access to bathroom. Radiator. \r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom  - 0.83m x 1.32m \r\nFully fitted with w.c. & wash-hand basin. Wooden paneling ceiling. Window to rear. \r\n\r\nShed 1 - 8.38m x 7.04m \r\nLarge garage door to front. Electric & light points. Stairs to overhead loft. Access to horse stable & tac room. \r\n\r\n\r\nHorse Stable - 3.80m x 4.41m \r\nOpen access to rear field. Ceiling wooden beams. Ceiling light fixture. \r\n\r\n\r\nTack Room  - 3.00m x 4.37m\r\nCeiling wooden beams. Electric & light points. \r\n\r\n\r\nLoft  - 7.38m x 4.73m\r\nAccess to rear. Window to rear. \r\n\r\n\r\nShed 2 - 13.09m x 7.38m  \r\nLarge garage door to front. Electric & light points. \r\n\r\n\r\nCottage\r\n\r\nEntrance Lobby  - 1.35m x 1.54m \r\nAccess to kitchen/dining room. Wooden floor. Vaulted ceiling. Ceiling wooden beams. Window to either side. \r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room - 3.09m x 5.59m \r\nFully fitted with wash-hand basin & solid fuel range cooker. Plumbed for all kitchen appliances. Stairs to overhead accommodation. Two windows to front. Ceiling wooden beams. Ceramic tiled floor in kitchen area & wooden floor in dining area. Open access into living room, rooms being divided by an internal window. Radiator. \r\n\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 3.19m x 6.34m \r\nAccess to front. Two windows to front. Solid fuel stove. Wooden floor. Ceiling wooden beams. Radiator. \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding/Open Plan Office - 6.17m x 3.59m \r\nAccess to all bedrooms, bathroom, airing cupboard & storage. Access to side. Vaulted ceiling. Ceiling wooden beams. Wooden floor. Two windows to rear. 6 panel window to front. Radiator. Telephone point. \r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom - 1.64m x 2.51m\r\nFully fitted with w.c., wash-hand basin & bathtub with overhead Triton shower unit. Ceramic tiled bathtub surround. 6 panel window to front. Feature stained window into bedroom one. Vaulted ceiling. Ceiling wooden beams. \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom One - 2.52m x 1.57m  \r\nWooden floor. Velux window to rear. Vaulted ceiling. Ceiling wooden beams. Radiator. \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom Two - 4.11m x 3.58m \r\nWooden floor. Window to rear. 6 panel window to front. Vaulted wooden panelling ceiling. Ceiling wooden beams. Radiator.\r\n\r\nFeatures & Services\r\n-Oil fired central heating\r\n-Private water & septic tank\r\n-Solar panels for hot water"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "-Character filled traditional farmhouse and cottage with outbuildings.\r\n-5 acres of paddocks woodlands with exquisite views.\r\n-Private and mature countryside setting.\r\n-Close to Ballineen, Enniskeane and Clonakilty.\r\n-Versatile property with further potential (detached cottage).\r\n-A short walking distance of 2km to Ballineen Village.\r\n-The main house has been substantially renovated over the years while keeping the feel and character of the original farmhouse.\r\n-The range of sheds and outbuildings gives plenty of flexibility for storage, animals, hobbies or other uses.\r\n-The cottage is a proper part of the property in its own right and provides very useful additional accommodation.\r\n-The long entrance and mature trees give the property a great sense of privacy on arrival."
      },
